            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 126991,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le app più grandi raggruppano valori simili, come i nomi dei tuoi amici in un social network.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA; &lt;style&gt;&#xA; .gridContainer {&#xA; display: grid;&#xA; grid-row-gap: 10px;&#xA; grid-template-columns: 300px;&#xA; grid-template-rows: 140px 50px 50px 50px;&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;.gridItem {&#xA; background-color: white;&#xA; border: 1px;&#xA; border-radius: 5px;&#xA; padding-top: 5px;&#xA; padding-left: 10px;&#xA; font-size: 20px;&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;.gridItem.tom {&#xA; text-align: left;&#xA; grid-column-start: 1;&#xA; grid-column-end: 2;&#xA; grid-row-start: 2;&#xA; grid-row-end: 3;&#xA;}&#xA;.gridItem.mia {&#xA; text-align: left;&#xA; grid-column-start: 1;&#xA; grid-column-end: 2;&#xA; grid-row-start: 3;&#xA; grid-row-end: 4;&#xA;}&#xA;.gridItem.lee {&#xA; text-align: left;&#xA; grid-column-start: 1;&#xA; grid-column-end: 2;&#xA; grid-row-start: 4;&#xA; grid-row-end: 5;&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;body {&#xA; background-color: #bfdaf9;&#xA; display:flex; &#xA; justify-content: center;&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;.gridItem img {&#xA; float: left;&#xA; height: 30px;&#xA; width: 30px;&#xA; margin-right: 10px;&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;p {&#xA; margin: 0px;&#xA; font-size: 25px;&#xA; padding-top: 7px;&#xA; color: #3e416d;&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;#meDiv {&#xA; border: 1px;&#xA; border-radius: 5px;&#xA; background-color: white;&#xA; text-align: center;&#xA; display: block;&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;#me {&#xA; height: 137px;&#xA; width: 137px;&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;#lee {&#xA; height: 26px;&#xA; width: 26px;&#xA;}&#xA; &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA; &lt;div class=&quot;gridContainer&quot;&gt;&#xA; &lt;div id=&quot;meDiv&quot;&gt;&#xA; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/tom.png&quot; id=&quot;me&quot;&gt;&#xA; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA; &lt;div class=&quot;gridItem tom&quot;&gt;&#xA; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/elijah.png&quot;&gt;Tom&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA; &lt;div class=&quot;gridItem mia&quot;&gt;&#xA; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/portrait-cv.png&quot;&gt;Mia&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA; &lt;div class=&quot;gridItem lee&quot;&gt;&#xA; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/lee.png&quot; id=&quot;lee&quot;&gt;Lee&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA; &#xA; &lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 126992,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Creare una variabile per ciascuno dei tuoi amici renderebbe il tuo codice lungo e complesso.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>friend1</code>, seguito da <code>friend2</code> e infine <code>friend3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Square brackets",
            "id": 126993,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invece di creare una variabile per il nome di ogni amico, possiamo raggruppare tutti i valori in un <strong>array</strong> usando <code>[</code> e <code>]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(friends)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;Tom&quot;, &quot;Mia&quot;, &quot;Lee&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>[</code>, seguito da <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Element",
            "id": 126994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I valori di un array si chiamano <strong>elementi</strong>. Ad esempio, <code>\"Tom\"</code>, <code>\"Mia\"</code> e <code>\"Lee\"</code> sono elementi di questo array.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;Tom&quot;, &quot;Mia&quot;, &quot;Lee&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Lee\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrays",
            "id": 126995,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare un array vuoto in Swift, usiamo <code>[]</code>, il tipo dell'array e <code>()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"]()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(friends)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>[String]</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Value in an array",
            "id": 126996,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inserire una stringa tra le parentesi quadre crea un array con un valore; prova con <code>\"Tom\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(friends)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;Tom&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>\"Tom\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrays",
            "id": 126997,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo le virgole <code>,</code> per separare due o più valori in un array, come <code>\"Tom\"</code> da <code>\"Mia\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(friends)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;Tom&quot;, &quot;Mia&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrays",
            "id": 126998,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In un array può stare un numero qualsiasi di valori. Per aggiungerne altri, scrivi una virgola e poi il valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(friends)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Tom', 'Mia', 'Lee']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>\"Lee\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
